AWPTCM-T9557 (1.0) — MAC/Phy TLV: port speed 100 duplex=half
tb470 IE520 stack · 2026-09-03 · RESULT: testCaseExcl (not producible on this platform)

Half-duplex is rejected on every IE520 front port, including empty ports (port-level, no module):
  duplex half  ->  "% Duplex set failed" / "% Unsupported speed/duplex combination"
The 1G ports accept speed 100 (full only); none accept half-duplex. See port-capability-matrix.txt.
Disposition: testCaseExcl — half-duplex unsupported on this platform. Not a defect.
